# 34. Regression Prevention

Before closing an outcome, verify:

- Shared APIs still work
- Shared settings remain authoritative
- Capability Matrix remains authoritative
- Runtime safety remains unchanged
- Related consumers still load
- Existing Browser QA still passes
- No performance regression
- No database integrity regression
- No Redis regression
- No PM2/Nginx regression
- No Git integrity regression
- Closed baselines remain unchanged

A feature is incomplete if it fixes one area and silently breaks another.

Regression scope must be based on proven dependencies.

